tic ReviewTask routing for missing visual evidence, rights/display blocker, Method evidence blocked, low-confidence method candidate, and source/render inconsistency.\n- Added synthetic-only fixture cases for clean strong diagnosis, candidate guidance, routing/logging only, suppressed diagnosis, and visual-dependent suppression.\n\n## Counts\n\n- Source question rows: 3530\n- Attempt loop target rows: 3530\n- Attemptable rows: 2672\n- Visual-placeholder rows: 159\n- Missing-visual blocked rows: 699\n- Review routing rules: 5\n- Fixture cases: 5\n- Real student attempt fixtures: 0\n- Method confidence blocks question availability rows: 0\n- Remote Supabase mutation performed: false\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-attempt-diagnosis-review-loop-contract.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-attempt-diagnosis-review-loop-fixtures.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-attempt-diagnosis-review-loop-contract.readback.md`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-attempt-diagnosis-review-loop-contract.validator-result.json`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-kg-v1-attempt-diagnosis-review-loop-contract.mjs --json` -> pass\n- `NODE_PATH=/home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-v1-attempt-diagnosis-review-loop-contract.test.js` -> 5 tests passed\n- `node scripts/quality/report-artifact-index-check.mjs` -> pass\n- `git diff --check` -> pass\n- `git diff --cached --check` -> pass before commit\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> healthy after push\n\n## PR Metadata\n\n- PR number: #1309\n- Head SHA: 034418953869d8fcf276de47e25101cb59104a35\n- Blockers: none known\n","created_at":"2026-07-05T14:02:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T14:19:30Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T14:17:40Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T14:17:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"aed6dd80dc43db3abf